## Test Fixtures & Micro-Weights

Every test audio clip, PCM array, image and micro-model fixture is listed below with its provenance and an MIT or CC0 license. The repository commits **no** model weights, audio clips or images: every fixture is generated deterministically at test time by Kggml's own (MIT) test code, and no upstream weights, audio or images are downloaded or used.

`scripts/ci/verify-licenses.sh` (run on every PR by `repo-hygiene.yml` and by `./scripts/ci-local.sh`) enforces this file: `LICENSE` must be the standard MIT text, every submodule and `FetchContent` commit pin must be recorded above (and every recorded commit must still be pinned), every tracked binary or model/audio/image/archive file must be listed here by path, and every fixture row must carry an MIT or CC0 license and point at generator sources that exist.

